            <h2 class="pipe">Custom Asphalt Paving, Site Excavation & Masonry in Westford, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> provides expert commercial parking lot paving, site excavation, and architectural stone masonry in <strong>Westford, Massachusetts</strong>. Located in northern Middlesex County, Westford contains elevated granite ridges, sandy glacial till, and high seasonal water tables near local ponds. Uncompacted subsoils deform under vehicle weight, while severe winter freezing cracks unreinforced asphalt driveways and stone walls. S. Phaneuf & Associates resolves these soil challenges through heavy subgrade compaction, installing catch basin drainage, and laying MassDOT-grade hot mix asphalt across Westford.</p>
