            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: How does S. Phaneuf & Associates manage steep slope driveway paving in Westford, MA?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates grades steep driveways to establish optimal drainage slopes, places heavy geotextile subgrade fabric, and compacts an 8-inch crushed stone aggregate base. Crews lay a two-course hot-mix asphalt structure and extrude Cape Cod berms along the driveway perimeter to prevent edge erosion during heavy rains and winter thaws in Westford.</p>

            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: Are waterfront hardscaping projects in Westford, MA subject to Conservation Commission oversight?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates submits detailed site plans to the Westford Conservation Commission for any hardscaping or excavation within 100 feet of Forge Pond or local wetlands. Crews install silt curtains, straw wattles, and erosion blankets to ensure total environmental protection throughout construction.</p>
